{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51796","headline":"洪州西山（句） · 王鼎","name":"洪州西山（句）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"林泉空有东西路，风月难寻十二家。\n（以上《全五代诗》六二引《诗话总龟》）（〖1〗见《诗话总龟》卷三二引《拾遗》。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王鼎","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51796.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51796","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}